rusteron-cluster

This crate re-implements, in Rust, Aeron Cluster (https://github.com/aeron-io/aeron),
version 1.54.2: its consensus module, clustered service container, client and
backup, their file formats and protocols, so as to interoperate with it on the
wire and on disk, from Aeron's Java sources. Its SBE codecs (src/codecs) are
generated from Aeron's schemas (schemas/):

